# panel-card-kanto 128x80. W10-C T2 cutscene panel (Class F
# card): the ARC COMPLETE card for arc kanto, played before the
# card text by showArcCompleteCard. Original in-house art,
# generated deterministically by w10c-rig/gen-panels-t2.mjs.
# Brief = the arc record (src/data/arcs.mjs): "Crown League —
# CHAMPION." / "Eight badges, one storm over Exile Isle, and a
# final against the rival who started it all. The Plateau wrote
# your team into its light." Dusk over the Plateau: its light
# pillar rising, the Exile Isle storm at the horizon, eight
# badge glints on the ledge = the recorded eight badges.
